rious crew cooperation issue. Might be disqualifying. C also egocentric, not willing to further education, communication difficulty. D hot temper also serious. A show-off, not open to new ideas.\n\nAll have concerns. Which is least concerning? B's nasty remarks maybe more severe than hot temper? Both affect crew. B's weak memory for numbers could affect attention. D's hot temper could affect crisis. C's egocentric and communication difficulty also severe.\n\nMaybe B is still best because strengths in reliability and stress are crucial. Let's propose B as current recommendation, but note concerns.\n\nWe need to reference no prior discussion, but we can say \"To start, I think Candidate B stands out because...\" Provide evidence.\n\nOk produce public message and metadata JSON with vote Candidate B."}
